---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Privacy Policy — FinTrack"
  description="FinTrack Privacy Policy — how we collect, use, and protect your personal and financial data."
  canonicalPath="/privacy"
  noindex={false}
>

<div style="padding-top:7rem;padding-bottom:6rem;background:var(--surface);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width:760px;">
    <div style="margin-bottom:3rem;">
      <span class="badge badge-green" style="margin-bottom:1rem;">Legal</span>
      <h1 style="font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);">Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--text-muted);">Last updated: June 13, 2026</p>
    </div>

    <div class="prose">
      <p>FinTrack ("we," "our," or "us") is committed to protecting your privacy. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, store, and share your personal and financial data when you use our services.</p>

      <h2>1. Information We Collect</h2>
      <h3>Account Data</h3>
      <p>When you create an account, we collect your name, email address, and password (stored as a bcrypt hash).</p>
      <h3>Financial Data</h3>
      <p>When you upload a bank statement, our OCR engine extracts transaction data (dates, amounts, merchant names, descriptions). The raw PDF is deleted after processing — we store only the extracted transaction records.</p>
      <h3>Usage Data</h3>
      <p>We collect anonymized usage analytics (pages visited, features used, session duration) to improve the product. We do not associate these with your financial data.</p>

      <h2>2. How We Use Your Data</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>To provide the FinTrack service (Safe-to-Spend calculation, categorization, analytics)</li>
        <li>To send you product updates and security alerts (you can unsubscribe at any time)</li>
        <li>To improve our AI categorization and OCR models using anonymized, aggregated patterns</li>
        <li>To comply with legal obligations in the UAE and other applicable jurisdictions</li>
      </ul>
      <p>We never sell, rent, or share your personal or financial data with third parties for marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>3. Data Security</h2>
      <p>All data is encrypted at rest using AES-256 and in transit using TLS 1.3. Our infrastructure is hosted on servers in the UAE and complies with UAE data residency requirements. We conduct regular third-party security audits.</p>

      <h2>4. Data Retention</h2>
      <p>Transaction data is retained for as long as your account is active, plus 90 days after account closure. You can delete your data at any time from Settings → Privacy → Delete All Data.</p>

      <h2>5. Your Rights</h2>
      <p>You have the right to:</p>
      <ul>
        <li>Access all data we hold about you (via Settings → Export Data)</li>
        <li>Correct inaccurate data</li>
        <li>Delete your data (via Settings → Privacy → Delete All Data)</li>
        <li>Withdraw consent for optional data processing</li>
        <li>Lodge a complaint with the UAE data protection authority</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>6. Cookies</h2>
      <p>We use essential cookies for authentication and session management. Optional analytics cookies are used only with your consent, which you can manage in our cookie preference centre.</p>

      <h2>7. Third-Party Services</h2>
      <p>We use the following third-party services that may process limited data:</p>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Stripe</strong> — Payment processing (they never see your financial transaction data)</li>
        <li><strong>Resend</strong> — Transactional email delivery</li>
        <li><strong>Sentry</strong> — Anonymized error reporting</li>
      </ul>

      <h2>8. Children's Privacy</h2>
      <p>FinTrack is not intended for users under 18. We do not knowingly collect data from minors.</p>

      <h2>9. Changes to This Policy</h2>
      <p>We'll notify you by email and in-app notification at least 14 days before any material change to this policy.</p>

      <h2>10. Contact Us</h2>
      <p>For privacy questions or data requests, contact our Data Protection Officer at <a href="mailto:privacy@fintrack.app" style="color:var(--green-700);">privacy@fintrack.app</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .prose h2 { font-size: 1.375rem; margin: 2.5rem 0 .875rem; color: var(--text-primary); padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .prose h3 { font-size: 1.0625rem; margin: 1.5rem 0 .5rem; color: var(--text-primary); }
  .prose p  { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .prose ul { color: var(--text-secondary); line-height: 1.85; margin-bottom: 1rem; padding-left: 1.5rem; }
  .prose ul li { margin-bottom: .375rem; }
  .prose a  { color: var(--green-700); }
</style>
